    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010All characters in the game are over 18 years old\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game is not currently a complete version. Updates will follow. The current version is v0.5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can play levels 1-9</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is a link to Discord on the right panel.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players will play the role of the head of an alchemy attic. Defeat the female cultivators and turn them into your own fighting force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can also interact with the female characters in the game, such as the boss lady selling goods in the countryside, the female cultivators in Dongshan, and the girls from foreign countries...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262320/extras/8ab168c22f4551ce57fd0921b830b6b9.avif?t=1740484944\" width=443 height=797 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You inherited the alchemy room left by your old and confused master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ordinary elixirs cannot be synthesized with conventional materials, but the master told you some clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is there a pig farm in an alchemy pavilion in the mountains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do women in Dongshan disappear frequently?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to explore all this.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262320/extras/7b2b73f966912c1abd58506c64085dd5.avif?t=1740484944\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Qionghua] </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A female monk from Dongshan, the gatekeeper at the checkpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262320/extras/642d7e158020c598ba7eb7f159bba81d.avif?t=1740484944\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Yun Shu]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A female cultivator from Dongshan, she is considered a senior sister in Dongshan. She has many junior sisters under her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262320/extras/674580f3608acacd746c9fe398327014.avif?t=1740484944\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Jinglan]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A member of the Dongshan sect's cabinet, whose strength cannot be ignored in Dongshan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262320/extras/b67f90f6e5b53038d30bc34709a47846.avif?t=1740484944\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Jingshu]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss lady of a rural market, why would such a beautiful woman sell goods in the countryside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since there are so many characters, I cannot introduce them one by one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262320/extras/9280738138be1733c2031a757a6ed705.avif?t=1740484944\" width=768 height=1152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game adopts the form of RPG battle, and the game is played in a turn-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the process of the game, the enemies you defeat will be transformed into your own [combat power] in the form of [alternative]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can also grow vegetables and refine pills to improve your combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262320/extras/48e4d260c71aa2f08012af864928b4b9.avif?t=1740484944\" width=800 height=1052 /></span>You will defeat the last female devil in Dongshan</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the strongest [or the most evil?] existence in Dongshan!</strong></h2>",
