ombat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262320/extras/48e4d260c71aa2f08012af864928b4b9.avif?t=1740484944\" width=800 height=1052 /></span>You will defeat the last female devil in Dongshan</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the strongest [or the most evil?] existence in Dongshan!</strong></h2>",
